Hanumān sees crystal bed with moonlike umbrella and perfumes --- Hanumān sees cloudlike Rāvaṇa with scarred banner arms breathing snakelike --- Hanumān retreats fearful then watches from landing --- Hanumān notes crown jewels sandal chest and four lamps --- Hanumān sees moon-faced wives with instruments sleeping around --- Hanumān finds adorned Mandōdarī lighting house on fair bed --- Hanumān mistakes Mandōdarī for Sītā and frolics monkey-like
